    "reason": "[ev-885b543fe7c5] only says the memcached timeout is now forced correct when fetching chunks. The linked PR [ev-1b2f6c4f7993][ev-e8e1f041f1df] just revendors the shared gomemcache client to pick up a deadline fix. It points to grafana/gomemcache#16 for details, but that text is not in the evidence. The evidence does not settle whether exposure is limited to the memcached chunk cache or covers every memcached-backed cache, and it names no config key, so the proposed bare \"memcached\" line match in config.yaml cannot be confirmed or narrowed. The deadline fix described in gomemcache#16 is needed, including which client calls it affects and what timeout applied before.",
